(6795931, 1021065, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nailed it - I believe.  Looks like a still from a sci-fi movie.  Excellently done.  Though, I think you could have brought up the hilights some, just to get rid of more of the blue sky and bring up her skin tones a bit more.  But that''s just a guess.  Very nice, especially for basic.<br/> <br/>I think I would have also leaned toward not using a patterned umbrella... but I''m glad you didn''t.  The pattern draws the eye upward into her face.<br/> <br/>Great shot, I hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Nailed it - I believe.  Looks like a still from a sci-fi movie.  Excellently done.  Though, I think you could have brought up the hilights some, just to get rid of more of the blue sky and bring up her skin tones a bit more.  But that''s just a guess.  Very nice, especially for basic. I think I would have also leaned toward not using a patterned umbrella... but I''m glad you didn''t.  The pattern draws the eye upward into her face. Great shot, I hope this ribbons.', '2012-06-15 09:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795934, 1021128, 142473, '<td valign="top">Initially not something I gave much thought to, but I like it.  This could also nearly pass for the abandoned challenge.  The blur in the lower third throws the eye out and up to the open window, where I believe herb to be waiting.</td>', 'Initially not something I gave much thought to, but I like it.  This could also nearly pass for the abandoned challenge.  The blur in the lower third throws the eye out and up to the open window, where I believe herb to be waiting.', '2012-06-15 09:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795935, 1021024, 142473, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the shadows and the subject.  A perfect marriage of the two images, with the sight lines perfectly aligned.  The crop is excellent, and it shows all that is needed.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the shadows and the subject.  A perfect marriage of the two images, with the sight lines perfectly aligned.  The crop is excellent, and it shows all that is needed.', '2012-06-15 09:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795939, 1020787, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like the reference, but believe the composition may be lacking.  The lone foreground element does put me in the picture some, and without it the image would be lacking further, but there is nothing to draw me into the image from the lone foreground element.  I wish more foreground was included I do believe.  I would like to see this same image in advanced editing too.  I imagine the smoke would come out a bit more punchy.</td>', 'I like the reference, but believe the composition may be lacking.  The lone foreground element does put me in the picture some, and without it the image would be lacking further, but there is nothing to draw me into the image from the lone foreground element.  I wish more foreground was included I do believe.  I would like to see this same image in advanced editing too.  I imagine the smoke would come out a bit more punchy.', '2012-06-15 09:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795952, 1020930, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the processing of this shot.  To me, it just looks way too washed out.  Though I do think the subject is a good one for the title, I just wish it was processed/executed differently.</td>', 'Not a fan of the processing of this shot.  To me, it just looks way too washed out.  Though I do think the subject is a good one for the title, I just wish it was processed/executed differently.', '2012-06-15 10:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
