(6796045, 1021024, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that is fantastic.  I like how you cut off the guy''s left eye, so we only see the one.  It adds to the fear factor.  8</td>', 'Oh that is fantastic.  I like how you cut off the guy''s left eye, so we only see the one.  It adds to the fear factor.  8', '2012-06-15 11:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
