(6796148, 1021133, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great busyness about this photo.  Waiting in line, walking his son, listening to music, leaning on a fence, business shoes, sneakers, blondes, brunettes, and hats.  I can only dream of shooting humanity''s variables in all it''s grace like this.</td>', 'Great busyness about this photo.  Waiting in line, walking his son, listening to music, leaning on a fence, business shoes, sneakers, blondes, brunettes, and hats.  I can only dream of shooting humanity''s variables in all it''s grace like this.', '2012-06-15 13:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6796152, 1021124, 142473, '<td valign="top">While the smoke is interesting and leads me into the "something", the image lacks some in execution to meet the title IMHO.  My eye gets totally lost in the in-focus area behind the "something".  A park? I see benches, maybe a playground?  Oh it doesn''t matter.  I also do not get the wickedness from the image itself, only from the title.  Without the title, I just assume it''s just a smoker taking a midnight stroll.  Not sure what the shoe is all about.  Maybe I''m doing too much to compare this directly to the other incredible image that is equally titled (which admittedly is not fair), but it doesn''t carry the same emotion - and I think that''s what this needs.</td>', 'While the smoke is interesting and leads me into the "something", the image lacks some in execution to meet the title IMHO.  My eye gets totally lost in the in-focus area behind the "something".  A park? I see benches, maybe a playground?  Oh it doesn''t matter.  I also do not get the wickedness from the image itself, only from the title.  Without the title, I just assume it''s just a smoker taking a midnight stroll.  Not sure what the shoe is all about.  Maybe I''m doing too much to compare this directly to the other incredible image that is equally titled (which admittedly is not fair), but it doesn''t carry the same emotion - and I think that''s what this needs.', '2012-06-15 13:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
