(6796973, 1021177, 99263, '<td valign="top"><a href="//thereisnobox.deviantart.com/art/Interval-In-Sunlight-6331045?q=sort%3Atime+favby%3Acolourscrash&amp;qo=0" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Interval in Sunlight</a> <br/>What is it to be insane?<br/>I don''t know.<br/>Do you know what insanity is?<br/>I don''t know.<br/>Can one tell? The coldness, was that the start?<br/>No.<br/>The heaviness, wasn''t that a part?<br/>Shut up.<br/>Is insanity screaming?<br/>I didn''t mean to.</td>', 'Interval in Sunlight What is it to be insane?I don''t know.Do you know what insanity is?I don''t know.Can one tell? The coldness, was that the start?No.The heaviness, wasn''t that a part?Shut up.Is insanity screaming?I didn''t mean to.', '2012-06-17 07:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
