(6799866, 1021073, 86218, '<td valign="top">Good grief. I havent been following DPC closely as of late and upon seeing the winning image I was not so much impressed by the small icon as I don''t normally have interest in expert editing challenges... Normally on Fridays. Checking the image however now and seeing this is basic!! And there is nothing digital about that sky painted in some computer software program, I am absolutely blown away. What a blessing to must have witnessed this and just savour the light.... And camera in hand. Brilliantly done and so fitting title. Congrats on the Blue. :)</td>', 'Good grief. I havent been following DPC closely as of late and upon seeing the winning image I was not so much impressed by the small icon as I don''t normally have interest in expert editing challenges... Normally on Fridays. Checking the image however now and seeing this is basic!! And there is nothing digital about that sky painted in some computer software program, I am absolutely blown away. What a blessing to must have witnessed this and just savour the light.... And camera in hand. Brilliantly done and so fitting title. Congrats on the Blue. :)', '2012-06-22 02:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
