(6801889, 1021024, 93565, '<td valign="top">It''s surprisingly hard to make knives show up in shots like this. I managed to get a few shots that that showed it nicely but were ultimately relegated to outtakes for Film Noir because I didn''t like the rest of them, and it took a good deal of work to make the knife even evident at all in the final. Nice shot, was pretty sure this one was yours.</td>', 'It''s surprisingly hard to make knives show up in shots like this. I managed to get a few shots that that showed it nicely but were ultimately relegated to outtakes for Film Noir because I didn''t like the rest of them, and it took a good deal of work to make the knife even evident at all in the final. Nice shot, was pretty sure this one was yours.', '2012-06-25 15:53:07.000000', NULL, 0),
